-                                        false)))
+                                  ;; An authentic cell reference carries
+                                  ;; the `:id` and `:seal` the VM issued
+                                  ;; it with; only that shape is
+                                  ;; dereferenced, as the descriptor
+                                  ;; projection does for a cell-backed
+                                  ;; callable (yang.antlr.md 8.10.2),
+                                  ;; whose entry lives in the cell
+                                  ;; contents. A source map spelled
+                                  ;; `{:type :cell-ref}` carries
+                                  ;; neither: it falls to the witness
+                                  ;; branch and, entryless, is no more
+                                  ;; admitted than any other source
+                                  ;; map. A forged full shape still
+                                  ;; reaches `cell/get`, where the VM
+                                  ;; seal refuses it.
+                                  (let [dsg__cell-ref?
+                                        (if (dsg__equal
+                                              (dsg__get dsg__candidate :type)
